sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pet owner
    participant R as serviceRoutes
    participant C as serviceController
    participant M as serviceBookingModel
    participant D as MySQL
    U->>R: POST /services/book (pet, service, date)
    R->>R: isLoggedIn
    R->>C: createBooking
    C->>C: validate input
    C->>M: createPendingBooking(ownerId, petId, serviceId, date)
    M->>D: BEGIN transaction
    M->>D: INSERT service_bookings (only if pet is yours and service is active; price comes from services table)
    M->>D: INSERT payments (status pending)
    M->>D: COMMIT
    M-->>C: success
    C-->>U: redirect /bookings with flash message
